<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Notes to the Unaudited Standalone Financial Results:   1. The above Unaudited Standalone Financial Results (SFR) of the Co. for the qtr. and nine months ended Dec 31,24 have been reviewed and recommended by the AC and approved by the BOD at its meeting held on Feb 03,25.   2. The above Unaudited SFR of the Co. have been prepared in accordance with Ind AS notified under Sec 133 of the Co.’s Act, 2013 read with the Companies (Ind AS Rules) 2015 and in terms of Reg 33 of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015.   3. During the year ended Mar 31,24 the Company had completed its IPO of 15196510 equity shares of face value of Rs 10 each comprising of (i) fresh issue of 4367088 equity shares at an issue price of Rs 790 per equity share (ii) fresh issue of 69930 equity shares at an issue price of Rs 715 per equity share for employee quota (iii) an offer for sale of 10759492 equity shares at an issue price of Rs 790 per equity share. The equity shares of the Co. were listed on BSE and NSE on Dec 20,23.   Details of the IPO net proceeds are as follows:   Particulars     Amount (as per offer document) (Rs lakhs)   Gross Proceeds from the fresh issue     35000.00   (Less) Estimated Issue related expenses    1842.50   (proportionate to Co.'s share)*     Net Proceeds       33157.50   *Issue related expenses (net of GST) amount to Rs 1533.09 lakhs have been adjusted against securities premium as per Sec 52 of the Co’s Act, 2013.   Details of the utilisation of IPO net proceeds is summarised below: (Rs lakhs)   Particulars        Objects of the issue       Utilised upto Dec 31,24       Unutilised as at Dec 31,24             (as per offer document)         Part financing of  28000.00   7252.37   20747.63   proposed project          General Corporate purposes 5157.50   5112.58   44.92   Total utilisation of funds 33157.50   12364.95   20792.55   Out of the Net proceeds which were unutilised as at Dec 31,24 Rs 20200.00 lakhs are temporarily invested in FD’s, Rs 401.07 lakhs is held in the Co.'s Monitoring Account, while the balance amount is held in the public offer account towards the Co.'s share of expenses related to Issue.   4. The Results for the qtr. and nine months ended Dec 31,23 and Standalone Financial Statements for the year ended Mar 31,24 were reviewed/audited by the previous statutory auditors of the Co.   5. Since the segment information as per IND AS 108 Operating segments, is provided in the Unaudited Consolidated Financial Results, the same is not provided separately in the Unaudited SFR.   6. During the qtr. ended Dec 31,24 the Nomination and Remuneration Committee of the Co. approved the grant of 117045 stock options under the Employee Stock Option Plan 2023 to eligible employees. These stock options will vest after a period of 5 years from the date of grant and can be exercised within 6 months from the date of vesting. The aforesaid stock options have been granted at an exercise price of Rs 250 per share, with the grant date being Oct 01,24. The resultant financial impact of this grant has been considered in these Unaudited SFR.   7. The Results for the qtr. and nine months ended Dec 31,24 will be available on the Co.'s website www.domsindia.com and also on the website of BSE www.bseindia.com and NSE www.nseindia.com, where the shares of the Co. are listed.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
